{
  "about": "Made by glazier-core's conformance.test.ts from media/video-probe.ts; do not edit. Frozen when Electron Oriel and glazier-core were removed (plan 063): Oriel RS's engine is the only implementation, and this is what it must still produce. Non-ASCII characters are escaped.",
